name: wet
author: waterbear
description: >
  wet seed. must Foil Splash + Showman ante 1; rank by Seltzer (and friends).
  Splash every card scores, Seltzer retriggers the soup, Showman lets the fizz stack.
deck: Red
stake: White

must:
  - uncommonJoker: Showman
    antes: [1]
  - commonJoker: Splash
    edition: Foil
    # antes open 1–8 so foil Splash still has room to land (ante-1-only is too tight)

should:
  - uncommonJoker: Seltzer
    score: 40
    label: seltzer
  - uncommonJoker: DietCola
    score: 20
    label: cola
  - commonJoker: IceCream
    score: 10
    label: ice
  - rareJoker: Blueprint
    score: 25
    label: bp

seeds:
  - 991199
